{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Welcome to the wonderful world of <strong>Middle Management!</strong></u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of our business as a <strong>Roguelite Office Simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That charming little blob is you! Make use of your vast managerial abilities to make your office as productive as possible! Your charming boss, and his influential clients eagerly await your results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the construction of a well-ordered and productive office, by hiring the right talent, building ergonomic rooms, and arranging performance enhancing furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/117a88767a5f6e561e889ffe983c26e2.poster.avif?t=1770590588\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/117a88767a5f6e561e889ffe983c26e2.webm?t=1770590588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/117a88767a5f6e561e889ffe983c26e2.mp4?t=1770590588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your workers brains are a dynamic thing, and they too must be managed responsibly, lest they develop suboptimal tendencies. Luckily your managerial abilities enable you to delve into the minds of your employees, to nudge their behaviors in the right directions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/0bed005aaae88c74b3639e322c08b9bf.poster.avif?t=1770590588\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/0bed005aaae88c74b3639e322c08b9bf.webm?t=1770590588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/0bed005aaae88c74b3639e322c08b9bf.mp4?t=1770590588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately some workers are beyond help, but fear not! In Middle Management, no worker goes to waste, and when they cannot work hard enough, they can be of benefit to the company in other ways! Make use of your unique skills to devour workers, or mutate them into forms that are entirely unrecognisable to their previous unproductive selves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/ff477955bd021dba4612759cb4afbabb.poster.avif?t=1770590588\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/ff477955bd021dba4612759cb4afbabb.webm?t=1770590588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/ff477955bd021dba4612759cb4afbabb.mp4?t=1770590588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>We can't wait to see you in the office!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/5efef9a8ffd039300dcc77fa807accec.avif?t=1770590588\" width=683 height=1059 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661500?t=1770590588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661500?t=1770590588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/ec5aa28f5c4ee57b53d37e63268b0af59a140ff9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770590588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/ec5aa28f5c4ee57b53d37e63268b0af59a140ff9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770590588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Welcome to the wonderful world of <strong>Middle Management!</strong></u>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of our business as a <strong>Roguelite Office Simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That charming little blob is you! Make use of your vast managerial abilities to make your office as productive as possible! Your charming boss, and his influential clients eagerly await your results!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the construction of a well-ordered and productive office, by hiring the right talent, building ergonomic rooms, and arranging performance enhancing furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/117a88767a5f6e561e889ffe983c26e2.poster.avif?t=1770590588\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661500/extras/117a88767a5f6e